OL,3,GNEWSA'Major milestone' as beavers
OL,4,Areleased into Loch Ness area
OL,5,
OL,6,FA family of six beavers have been
OL,7,Freleased into the Loch Ness catchment,
OL,8,F500 years since the species was last
OL,9,Frecorded there.
OL,11,FThe beavers were reintroduced to the
OL,12,FDundreggan rewilding estate in
OL,13,FGlenmoriston, having been relocated
OL,14,Ffrom elsewhere in Scotland.
OL,16,FThe Ness Beaver Project will
OL,17,Freintroduce at least 15 beaver family
OL,18,Fgroups into lochs, lochans and rivers
OL,19,Faround Loch Ness over the next three
OL,20,Fyears.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
